-- Date:    2026-11-26
-- Purpose: Blackmaw Hold (map 2974) as live has it (world 2026_11_26_40..42, from Karrz's capture of 25-26 Nov 2026). Live lands a
--          player at the tunnel's north end (3375.09,3822.24,306.98), not at (3470,3690) as 0044 had it, the Blackmaw Behemoth and
--          Clawbert stand low in the west hall (136 y) where Elder Shaman Bloodmane stood, Bloodmane in the east cave where they stood,
--          and Varrox Bleakhoof waits in a deep chamber about 200 y below the Behemoth's hall (z -62), not in the high north room
--          0062 walked to. That chamber is not joined to the rest of the navmesh: after the Behemoth Karrz walked west to the hall's
--          edge and fell (from (3423.8,2936.9,133.4), 4.5 s), into a pool (START_SWIM at 3396.2,2921.1,-65.5, no fall damage), swam
--          north-east to the shore and walked to Varrox. There is no way back up. So:
--           * a one-way nav link from that edge to that splash (bots fall it as a jump, PlayerbotAPI move_to drop),
--           * a new route: the landing, then Withermaw, Bonesnout the Unbroken, Impaan the Imprisoner, the Unbound Spirit, Elder
--             Shaman Bloodmane and the Blackmaw Behemoth, the link's mouth, the splash, and Varrox last (about 4150 y, the shortest
--             walk from the landing that ends with the Behemoth before the fall, BlackmawHoldScript.cpp has the same order).
--          Built from the map 2974 navmesh: a crumb every 20 y of walked path or so (209 crumbs, gaps up to 30 y), every crumb-to-crumb
--          leg but the fall is a path on the navmesh of at most 9 polygons. The pool is in the chamber's navmesh (its water
--          polygons), so the swim to the shore needs no second link.
-- Reverts: yes (0044 and 0062's route of map 2974, delete the link).

-- @target: shared

DELETE FROM {SHARED}.playerbot_dungeon_routes WHERE map_id = 2974;


-- The west edge of the Behemoth's hall, on the navmesh 3 y short of where Karrz left it, to where he hit the water. One way.
DELETE FROM {SHARED}.playerbot_nav_links WHERE map_id = 2974 AND kind = 'drop' AND comment LIKE 'Blackmaw Hold Behemoth hall%';
